# Followed Instagram accounts
#
# One handle per line. Optional inline note after `|`. Blank lines and lines
# starting with `#` are ignored, so use them to group/annotate.
#
# SETUP: copy this file to `igaccounts.md` and replace the entries below with the
# accounts you want to follow (or, if you keep state in a separate repo, put your
# real igaccounts.md in $AGENT_STATE_DIR/config/).
#
#   cp config/igaccounts.md.example config/igaccounts.md
#
# The agent detects new posts on each account, filters them for relevance, and
# proposes related accounts as suggestions you approve. Approved handles are
# appended here automatically by `approve --ig` or the web admin UI.

# brands
maurten_official | gels / endurance nutrition (global)
scienceinsport   | gels / endurance nutrition (global)

# organizations / races
utmbmontblanc    | trail running (global)
wser             | Western States 100 (global)

# news
trailrunningmag  | trail running news (global)
